unkernel (https://github.com/pithings/unkernel) adds these files to this
system: the kw layer of its base initramfs (/usr/bin/kwbox,
/usr/sbin/kw-overlay, /usr/lib/kw/, /usr/lib/kw-base,
/etc/profile.d/kw-path.sh, kw-term.sh and kw-gl.sh, /etc/X11/xorg.conf.d/*-kw-*.conf,
this file) and, in the distro image, the files named kw-* or under
/usr/lib/kw/ and the ones its build changes.

